          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"movies\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"38533\",\"name\":\"THE LAST ONE FOR THE ROAD\",\"showingStatus\":\"Now Playing\",\"urlSlug\":\"thelast-one-for-the-road\",\"posterImage\":\"abn93tw8ms4as2izhnq1s94emkeg\",\"bannerImage\":\"ydpfkgu2r3o5qesso0b150icqhco\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 27px; margin-bottom: 0px; border: 0px;\\\"\\u003eSurviving bar-to-bar on anecdotes and the ‘good old days’, two blustery 50-somethings hatch a plan to change their luck by digging up the cash their old pal buried before he left for Argentina. En route to the airport, they come across a shy architecture student whose view of life will transform as they take him under their wing on a road trip across the Venetian plains.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 27px; margin-bottom: 0px; border: 0px;\\\"\\u003eTHE LAST ONE FOR THE ROAD is the boozy road movie you didn’t know you needed this summer. Take a trip across Northern Italy with this charming, crazy adventure and fabulous performances by Filippo Scotti (The Hand of God), Sergio Romano, and Pierpaolo Capovilla.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Filippo Scotti, Sergio Romano, Pierpaolo Capovilla\",\"directedBy\":\"Francesco Sossai\",\"producedBy\":\"Gregorio Paonessa, Marta Donzelli\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":98,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"970EvAbQ3qI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":1.8003,\"tmdbId\":\"1462322\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"472026\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Last one for the road, the [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"459603\",\"time\":\"2026-07-10T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":12,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":48,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459607\",\"time\":\"2026-07-11T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":55,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459611\",\"time\":\"2026-07-12T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459615\",\"time\":\"2026-07-13T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":53,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459619\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459623\",\"time\":\"2026-07-15T14:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459627\",\"time\":\"2026-07-16T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38530\",\"name\":\"ROSEBUSH PRUNING\",\"showingStatus\":\"Now Playing\",\"urlSlug\":\"rosebush-pruning\",\"posterImage\":\"rylli4q1qzsmq4rwcr0fo1kzuezd\",\"bannerImage\":\"biyuihxa9de36xa95v6sqwnukj3a\",\"synopsis\":\"Underneath the Catalonian sun, a rich white American family lives in hedonistic isolation, seeking love and validation through one another, their designer wardrobes and pop music. When an outsider infiltrates the family, buried tensions surface and blood ties are severed.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eA stylish at-the-rich satire, ROSEBUSH PRUNING is penned by the long term Yorgos Lanthimos' screenwriter, Efthimis Filippou. The starry cast includes\\u0026nbsp;Riley Keough, Callum Turner, Elle Fanning and\\u0026nbsp;Jamie Bell.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Callum Turner, Riley Keough, Jamie Bell\",\"directedBy\":\"Karim Aïnouz\",\"producedBy\":\"Viola Fügen, Michael Weber, Simone Gattoni\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":95,\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"allGenres\":\"Comedy, Drama, Thriller\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"rmHD9gZbF7A\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":5.0759,\"tmdbId\":\"1130948\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"499395\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Rosebush Pruning [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"459601\",\"time\":\"2026-07-10T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459600\",\"time\":\"2026-07-10T19:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":53,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459605\",\"time\":\"2026-07-11T12:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459604\",\"time\":\"2026-07-11T17:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459609\",\"time\":\"2026-07-12T14:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459608\",\"time\":\"2026-07-12T16:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459613\",\"time\":\"2026-07-13T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"captions\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459612\",\"time\":\"2026-07-13T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459617\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459616\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T19:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459621\",\"time\":\"2026-07-15T12:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459620\",\"time\":\"2026-07-15T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459625\",\"time\":\"2026-07-16T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459624\",\"time\":\"2026-07-16T19:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38528\",\"name\":\"EFFI O BLAENAU\",\"showingStatus\":\"Now Playing\",\"urlSlug\":\"effi-o-blaenau\",\"posterImage\":\"h02b49fh85s7013p17j2ywtk4mzr\",\"bannerImage\":\"t7ahbj0q0hyvcw51dwgioflesya7\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eBased on Gary Owen's much lauded and widely performed monodrama, Iphigenia in Splott, EFFI O BLAENAU is director Marc Evans' cinematic interpretation set against the wide open landscapes of North Wales. \\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe film follows Effi (Leisa Gwenllian), a young woman desperate to escape a town where the pubs are closed, the jobs have vanished and her grandmother works night shifts in the local chip shop just to get by. A chance encounter in a Llandudno nightclub with injured soldier Lee, played by Tom Rhys Harries, briefly opens a door to something better. For a moment, Effi glimpses a life she never imagined. The reality that follows is far tougher.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - Guardian\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - Time Out\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - The Times\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - The Financial Times\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Leisa Gwenllian, Tom Rhys Harries, Owen Alun\",\"directedBy\":\"Marc Evans\",\"producedBy\":\"Branwen Cennard\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"zKAUC36uAsk\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":2.0537,\"tmdbId\":\"1643807\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"498887\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Effi O Blaenau [15]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"459602\",\"time\":\"2026-07-10T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459606\",\"time\":\"2026-07-11T14:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":52,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459610\",\"time\":\"2026-07-12T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459614\",\"time\":\"2026-07-13T12:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459618\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T12:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459622\",\"time\":\"2026-07-15T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":55,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"459626\",\"time\":\"2026-07-16T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2 subtitled\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38510\",\"name\":\"THE INVITE\",\"showingStatus\":\"Now Playing\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-invite\",\"posterImage\":\"n13shnum8jvrv1ckcrl7jsz05lnt\",\"bannerImage\":\"bgegr3fs9o14j29obj58dap8d3kj\",\"synopsis\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★★ - The Times\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Guardian\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e★★★★ - Little White Lies\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Empire Magazine\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Time Out\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Seth Rogen, Olivia Wilde, Penélope Cruz\",\"directedBy\":\"Olivia Wilde\",\"producedBy\":\"Megan Ellison, Ben Browning, David Permut\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":107,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama, Comedy\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"7YIHRhRMn94\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":24.0815,\"tmdbId\":\"950028\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"488731\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Invite, The [15]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"110\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"452292\",\"time\":\"2026-07-03T16:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":51,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"452295\",\"time\":\"2026-07-03T19:20:00Z\",\"t