21T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448062\",\"time\":\"2026-07-21T14:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448061\",\"time\":\"2026-07-21T18:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"captions\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448082\",\"time\":\"2026-07-22T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448083\",\"time\":\"2026-07-22T14:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448084\",\"time\":\"2026-07-22T18:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448085\",\"time\":\"2026-07-23T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448086\",\"time\":\"2026-07-23T14:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448087\",\"time\":\"2026-07-23T18:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"141\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc2\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37968\",\"name\":\"LIFE SUPPORT + LIVE Q\\u0026A\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"life-support-live-qa\",\"posterImage\":\"i84gzeb67lqbf61qmw166n9643pp\",\"bannerImage\":\"b4gnpsnp8rgxyuwjj6c8ss7d2xzk\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cspan id=\\\"docs-internal-guid-6ce95336-7fff-24e0-e95b-e6c017609bd9\\\" style=\\\"caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont color=\\\"#222222\\\" face=\\\"Arial, sans-serif\\\" size=\\\"2\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"\\u003eA group of international doctors breach the blockade of Gaza. What they find is the calculated dismantling of life itself.\\n\\nSince October 2023, Gaza has been sealed from the world-except for one group, international doctors. While global media are barred from reporting and governments look away, doctors breach the blockade and what they find is not just a humanitarian crisis, but a calculated dismantling of life itself. \\n\\nCovering the entire two years of the genocide, their firsthand accounts and visceral footage offer a rare and vital chronicle of the daily struggles of healthcare workers as they navigate bombed-out hospitals, dwindling supplies, starvation and the overwhelming influx of casualties— predominantly women and children.\\n\\nThe screening will be follower by a panel discussion with director Daniele Rugo and Amira Nimerawi, Co-Founder/CEO of Healthcare Workers for Palestine, moderated by renowned documentarian \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: HelveticaNeue; font-size: 12px;\\\"\\u003eAshok Prasad.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Prof Nick Maynard, Dr Tanya Haj Hassan, Dr Victoria Rose, Dr Khaled Dawas, Dr Deborah Harrington, Dr James Smith, Dr Ana Jeelani, Dr Graeme Groom, Dr Ahmed Al Mokhallalati, Dr Tom Potokar, Dr Mhoira Leng.\",\"directedBy\":\"Daniele Rugo\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":\"Documentary\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Si8lAPXrh38\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-17\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"136258\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"10 Things I Hate About Life (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"439329\",\"time\":\"2026-07-17T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":28,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":46,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers qa\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38612\",\"name\":\"SEND FRIENDLY SCREENING: TOY STORY 5\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"send-friendly-screening-toy-story-5\",\"posterImage\":\"69cpdrebgxvlsvpfkfmald0v0wy6\",\"bannerImage\":\"eciyoflwqcqcyv2b9hvtt9v9yfaj\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eWhen Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px; font-family: \\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\\u0026quot;; text-align: center;\\\"\\u003eSEND Friendly Screenings are specifically designed to help persons with special education needs. Lights are left on low, volume is reduced, the audience is free to move around and the screening room is equipped with cushions and yoga mats. Additionally, these screenings will run with no pre-show, so the advertised time will reflect the starting time of the film.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px; font-family: \\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\\u0026quot;; text-align: center;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Time Out\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Empire Magazine\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Little White Lies\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Daily Telegraph\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack\",\"directedBy\":\"Andrew Stanton\",\"producedBy\":\"Lindsey Collins, Jessica Choi\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":102,\"genre\":\"Animation\",\"allGenres\":\"Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"RFm6wN7IhtY\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-19\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":666.921,\"tmdbId\":\"1084244\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"18642\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Godsend (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"158\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"448093\",\"time\":\"2026-07-19T09:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":39,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"send-friendly sc1\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"454792\",\"time\":\"2026-07-22T09:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":60,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"send-friendly sc1\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38611\",\"name\":\"CARERS \\u0026 BABIES: THE ODYSSEY\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"carers-babies-the-odyssey\",\"posterImage\":\"orq0aic8gg2snz9i3pa5k56mxzol\",\"bannerImage\":\"xghu8nlhwvtilqczscvlq67yz3uj\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eThis performance is exclusive to our\\u0026nbsp;\\u003ca href=\\\"https://actonecinema.co.uk/carers--babies-club\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\u003eCARERS \\u0026amp; BABIES CLUB\\u003c/a\\u003e. You must have at least one baby in your party aged 0-12 months old.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eOdysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Matt Damon, Tom Holland, Anne Hathaway\",\"directedBy\":\"Christopher Nolan\",\"producedBy\":\"Christopher Nolan, Emma Thomas\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":172,\"genre\":\"Adventure\",\"allGenres\":\"Adventure, Action, Fantasy\",\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":106.61,\"tmdbId\":\"1368337\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"412037\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Match Found\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"157\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"448094\",\"time\":\"2026-07-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"carers--babies sc1\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39231\",\"name\":\"LIVE CONCERT: MARY JANE \\u0026 BENJAMIN ROCCA\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"live-concert-mary-jane-benjamin-rocca\",\"posterImage\":\"jnir34qkbms6osr8d4s8ko2dnefx\",\"bannerImage\":\"i1glt3fzbvsp4p8d9ig7qh0pebbq\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.666667px;\\\"\\u003eJoin London based jazz musicians Mary Jane and Benjamin Rocca for an evening of unforgettable songs from the movies. From timeless film classics to contemporary favourites, each is reimagined with elegant jazz arrangements. With a background in acting, Mary Jane brings warmth and authentic storytelling to every performance, while Guildhall-trained pianist Benjamin Rocca's expressive playing provides the perfect musical backdrop. Together, they celebrate the magic of cinema through the timeless language of jazz.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.666667px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.666667px;\\\"\\u003eMary Jane blends the elegance of classic jazz with a contemporary style. Her repertoire spans timeless jazz standards and modern pop favourites reimagined with sophisticated jazz arrangements, creating a sound that feels both familiar and fresh. Drawing on her background in acting, she brings warmth, authenticity, and storytelling to every performance.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.666667px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\"elementToProof\\\"\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.666667px;\\\"\\u003eBenjamin Rocca is a jazz pianist, composer and bandleader. A Master’s graduate of the Guildhall School of Music \\u0026amp; Drama, he combines virtuosic technique with expressive, soulful playing to create a sound that is both rooted in tradition and unmistakably contemporary. Drawing inspiration from artists including Bill Evans, Keith Jarrett, Herbie Hancock and Robert Glasper, his music is energetic, lyrical, and compelling.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"b30qL9LW0m4\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-25\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"463547\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"#runseokjin_ep.tour in amsterdam: live viewing (concert) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"460340\",\"time\":\"2026-07-25T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-in-the-lounge live-music\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37160\",\"name\":\"SOUL TO SOUL\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"soul-to-soul\",\"posterImage\":\"q16es4rgzf2xc1u0fbao8upuv1f4\",\"bannerImage\":\"h6rw9h0ic277po7xwl01o38rwuft\",\"synopsis\":\"Soul To Soul, a vibrant and historically significant 1971 concert film — featuring performances by Ike \\u0026amp; Tina Turner, Santana, Wilson Pickett, the Staples Singers, Les McCann \\u0026amp; Eddie Harris, and The Voices of East Harlem.\\n\\nIn February 1971, several dozen African American soul, jazz, and gospel artists embarked on a journey that would change the lives of everyone involved. They travelled from New York City to Ghana, West Africa to take part in a 13-hour concert entitled Soul To Soul. The concert was a celebration of 14 years of Ghana’s independence from British rule. For most of these artists, it would be their first trip to Africa. For the African American musicians, this was a journey about personal roots, the ancestral homeland, history, discovery, loss, pain and joy.\\n\\nDirected by Academy Award winner Denis Sanders and produced by Tom Mosk \\u0026amp; Richard Bock, the resulting concert film/documentary had a limited theatrical run in late 1971. \\n\\nNow, 55 years later, Soul To Soul will have another chance to connect with audiences. The film has been restored and reconstructed using the high quality 2K transfers from the original film elements, and the soundtrack has been remastered.\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color: rgb(230, 226, 214);\\\"\\u003e★★★★ - Guardian\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Tina Turner, Ike Turner, Roberta Flack\",\"directedBy\":\"Denis Sanders\",\"producedBy\":\"Richard Bock, Tom Mosk\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":96,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":\"Music\",\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"nbZ7qoePQP0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-26\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.1641,\"tmdbId\":\"306644\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"419453\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Soul To Soul (Re: 2026) [u]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"430150\",\"time\":\"2026-07-26T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":53,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event restoration\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"17282\",\"name\":\"FUN IN THE LOUNGE - FREE ENTRY: OPEN MIC\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"free-fun-at-the-lounge-open-mic\",\"posterImage\":\"m7x0lx0w2z7hcz1p6zj2a80e39dn\",\"bannerImage\":\"03e90oqz0q1333idlt2kfbqymlb7\",\"synopsis\":\"FREE ENTRY - Please RSVP for free below so we can manage numbers - Donations help us keep our community events free!\\n\\nOur Open Mic Nights take place on the last Thursday of each month, from 8pm. Sign up for performers is from 7:30PM; 10min slots per act.\\n\\nGet notified of all our free events by becoming a member on our Meetup Groups: \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.meetup.com/west-london-board-games-meetup-group/\\\"\\u003eWest London Board Games\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.meetup.com/free-open-mic-jazz-nights-in-west-london/\\\"\\u003eFree Open Mic \\u0026 Jazz Nights in West London\\u003c/a\\u003e!\\n\\nDo you love to perform? What about that two minute comedy sketch you've been writing and want to try out in front of an audience? Whether you write poetry or perform with an instrument, ActOne's Open Mic Night is a warm and welcoming community space in which to experiment, play and meet likeminded individuals who are being brave and putting themselves out there.\\n\\nOur Open Mic Nights are for everyone! We aim to cultivate an atmosphere of energy, enthusiasm and unconditional support, so whether you wish to perform or sit back and be entertained come ready to clap your hands until they're sore!\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"37604\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"All The Best - The Fun Begins (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"214730\",\"time\":\"2024-08-29T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":19,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":31,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"221734\",\"time\":\"2024-09-26T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":37,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"234089\",\"time\":\"2024-10-24T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":39,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"244599\",\"time\":\"2024-11-28T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":29,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":21,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"251537\",\"time\":\"2024-12-19T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":43,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"257778\",\"time\":\"2025-01-30T20:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":34,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":