creenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":32,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"388635\",\"time\":\"2026-02-26T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":12,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":38,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"401361\",\"time\":\"2026-03-26T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":18,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":32,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"417195\",\"time\":\"2026-04-30T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"436014\",\"time\":\"2026-05-28T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":26,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":24,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"430251\",\"time\":\"2026-05-29T01:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"324\",\"seatsRemaining\":10,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"439383\",\"time\":\"2026-06-25T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":14,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":36,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"463219\",\"time\":\"2026-07-30T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38992\",\"name\":\"MOLLY + DIRECTOR Q\\u0026A\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"molly-director-qa\",\"posterImage\":\"6tumztpdx7ec2b4n599opkt0buu0\",\"bannerImage\":\"di61vy2zjflav5kxj084nr6japiw\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eActOne is delighted to present a special screening and Q\\u0026amp;A with local director Darius Shu.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eThe event is comprised of the screening of the shorts DEAR GOOGLE and MOLLY followed by a live conversation with the director.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eDear Google\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eA young boy's racial identity and insecurities emerge from the perspective of his Google browser search history.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eMolly\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cfont face=\\\"HelveticaNeue\\\"\\u003eA chance encounter at a launderette sparks a meaningful connection between Vinnie and Ryan. As closeness blurs into desire, they are forced to confront what love demands before it fractures everything they have built.\\u003c/font\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Starring Hiroki Berrecloth, Frank Kauer\",\"directedBy\":\"Darius Shu\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":60,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-01\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-01\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"337721\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Drover's Wife: The Legend Of Molly Johnson, The (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"455017\",\"time\":\"2026-08-01T11:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":18,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers qa\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"17560\",\"name\":\"FUN IN THE LOUNGE - FREE ENTRY: BOARD GAMES\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"fun-at-the-lounge---free-entry-board-games\",\"posterImage\":\"zd1egphtlaiiru9m2qozcm3pk83r\",\"bannerImage\":\"e2jlqavsfbw2kiq8hw5fgu6hmi37\",\"synopsis\":\"FREE ENTRY - Please RSVP for free below so we can manage numbers - Donations help us keep our community events free!\\n\\nOur Board Games Evenings take place the first Wednesday of every month.\\n\\nGet notified of all our free events by becoming a member on our Meetup Groups: \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.meetup.com/west-london-board-games-meetup-group/\\\"\\u003eWest London Board Games\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.meetup.com/free-open-mic-jazz-nights-in-west-london/\\\"\\u003eFree Open Mic \\u0026 Jazz Nights in West London\\u003c/a\\u003e!\\n\\nJoin us for an evening of gaming fun, chat and drinks! Whether you're a seasoned gamer or brand new to the world of board games, this event is perfect for everyone. You can bring and host your own games, join other people's games or play one from our newbie-friendly collection. If you don't know how to play a game someone will teach you and if you come alone we'll help you find a group.\\n\\nSome notes:\\nYou can join anytime after 6pm, but the earliest you come, the easier will be to find a group.\\nAll the games either belong to the group or to individuals who come to the meetup. Please take good care of all games - be careful with nearby drinks, help put everything back in the box after you're done and return them to the owner/organiser.\\nWe are of course LGBTQI+ friendly!\\nPets are welcome!\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":240,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"37604\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"All The Best - The Fun Begins (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"216648\",\"time\":\"2024-09-04T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":46,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"221735\",\"time\":\"2024-10-02T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":43,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"234090\",\"time\":\"2024-11-06T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":16,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":34,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"247070\",\"time\":\"2024-12-04T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":42,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"254699\",\"time\":\"2025-01-08T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"264142\",\"time\":\"2025-02-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"270805\",\"time\":\"2025-03-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":31,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":19,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"278419\",\"time\":\"2025-04-02T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"288457\",\"time\":\"2025-05-07T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":18,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":32,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"301488\",\"time\":\"2025-06-04T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":31,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":19,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"308582\",\"time\":\"2025-07-02T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":19,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":31,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-at-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"317670\",\"time\":\"2025-08-06T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":19,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":31,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"330049\",\"time\":\"2025-09-03T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":26,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":24,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"341796\",\"time\":\"2025-10-01T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":19,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":31,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"354335\",\"time\":\"2025-11-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":23,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":27,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"373415\",\"time\":\"2025-12-03T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":8,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":42,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"381454\",\"time\":\"2026-01-07T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":27,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":23,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390018\",\"time\":\"2026-02-04T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"400972\",\"time\":\"2026-03-04T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"400977\",\"time\":\"2026-04-01T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":33,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":17,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"420693\",\"time\":\"2026-05-06T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":15,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":35,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"430252\",\"time\":\"2026-06-03T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":10,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":40,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"445600\",\"time\":\"2026-07-01T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":37,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"463256\",\"time\":\"2026-08-05T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":49,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39230\",\"name\":\"LIVE CONCERT: JAGO \\u0026 ANNA\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"live-concert-jago-anna\",\"posterImage\":\"84nv6y6stbh5fd9y5af3ius8mca3\",\"bannerImage\":\"75ye6scwrm48qxrq0pvn59ye617j\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14.000001px;\\\"\\u003eAnna and Jago draw inspiration from the great guitar-vocal pairings such as Julie London and Barmey Kessel or Ella Fitzgerald and Joe Pass to deliver an intimate, bluesy take on standards and Great American Songbook classics.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAnna Arbiter is a singer, writer and artist, often found exhibiting paintings or fronting various jazz and blues groups around London.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eGuitarist Jago Furnas grew up locally and returns from gigging in Europe, the US and his adoptive home of South London to play a long-overdue hometown show.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eDoors will open at 7pm and the concert with start at 7:30pm.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Bj0yVFEp0ik\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"460217\",\"time\":\"2026-08-14T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event live-music\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38644\",\"name\":\"MUPPET TREASURE ISLAND SING-ALONG SCREENING AND PIRATE HAT MAKING WORKSHOP\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"muppet-treasure-island-sing-along-screening-and-pirate-hat-making-workshop\",\"posterImage\":\"hxp8tzf0ymf6e7mfq32gzsm0d6lu\",\"bannerImage\":\"nzw7m1gkn5glcy8h4lybibsr7pli\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eSet sail with the whole family as ActOne transforms MUPPET TREASURE ISLAND into a sing-along summer celebration for pirates of all ages!\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eJoin us as we celebrate the film’s 30th birthday during International Pirate Month (Arr-gust). The adventure begins at 11:00am with a pirate hat-making workshop (all materials provided) before we dive straight into this musical adventure at 11:30am.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eParents and guardians must supervise children throughout the event. Recommended for ages 3+.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Frank Oz, Dave Goelz, Jerry Nelson, Steve Whitmire, John Henson, Tim Curry, Bill Connolly, Ed Bishop, Jennifer Saunders\",\"directedBy\":\"Brian Henson\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"U\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"KLUdKoCganU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"454633\",\"time\":\"2026-08-14T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38643\",\"name\":\"MUPPET TREASURE ISLAND DRINK-AND-SING-ALONG\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"muppet-treasure-island-drink-and-sing-along\",\"posterImage\":\"d06iwz6flitejfwhpa7m6zqxvtbl\",\"bannerImage\":\"udxg2798fwuyk7f48bvd6na2go6f\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eLeave your inhibitions at the door as ActOne turns MUPPET TREASURE ISLAND into an interactive, drink-and-sing-along, summer screening celebrating the film’s 30th birthday!\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eGrab a margarita and join us as we cheer, jeer, and shout “Yarr!” while setting sail across the big blue wet thing. Sing along with Tim Curry, beware the one-legged pirate, and catch a serious case of cabin fever.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003ePirate dress is strongly encouraged, with prizes for our favourite costumes.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThis is an 18+ event in a casual environment, with the bar serving all night. Doors will open at 8:00pm and the event will start at 8:15pm. Arrive early to enjoy our Dark and Stormy Seas cocktails before we cast off.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThere will be no ads or trailers before the film. The screening includes a 15-minute interval.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Frank Oz, Dave Goelz, Jerry Nelson, Steve Whitmire, John Henson, Tim Curry, Bill Connolly, Ed Bishop, Jennifer Saunders\",\"directedBy\":\"Brian Henson\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":150,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"KLUdKoCganU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-08-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"5585\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Muppet Treasure Island (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"454634\",\"time\":\"2026-08-14T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":18,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":42,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"25589\",\"name\":\"CORINA KWAMI DUO: STORIES OF HOME AND AWAY\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"corina-kwami-live-concert\",\"posterImage\":\"04d0ou8n3oyradk3y6bkufkpnp1x\",\"bannerImage\":\"x0yt83azmneminkrlcd8xv8rdqp8\",\"synopsis\":\"Blending stories of home and experiences across the globe, Corina Kwami brings this to life through jazz, afro and soulful connections with the backdrop of the colour blue. Storytelling sparks reflection on the past and hope for the future. And part of listening to stories is to imagine the scenes, characters and colours that are knitted together in reflections and memories. Inspired by Imaani Perry's use of the color blue in the book ‘Black in Blues’ - a springboard for telling stories of the African diaspora- , Corina builds from her earliest roots and the people who have really shaped her along the way. As a former competive swimmer, water expert and jazz vocalist, the colour 'blue' has been a source of inspiration in all senses of the word - swimming pools, freshwater and the blues roots in jazz music. From Ghana to Canada, the Caribbean to the US and many cities in between, this show will bring those 'bluescapes' of sound through a multi-media experience, together with guitarist Clement Regert.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Fp0DNIXIhqA\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-09-12\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-09-12\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"315549\",\"time\":\"2025-07-12T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"326480\",\"time\":\"2025-09-20T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":28,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":22,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-in-the-lounge\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"398623\",\"time\":\"2026-03-28T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":17,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":33,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"fun-in-the-lounge live-music\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"451273\",\"time\":\"2026-09-12T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-in-the-lounge live-music\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39232\",\"name\":\"ANDY GOLDSWORTHY IN CONVERSATION WITH ANDREW GRAHAM-DIXON + LIVE Q\\u0026A\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"andy-goldsworthy-in-conversation-with-andrew-graham-dixon-live-qa\",\"posterImage\":\"a5tu95w9oneccbf3ke2f10djkemf\",\"bannerImage\":\"16kat13q7j45gu5a533bt4y4o1o8\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eANDY GOLDSWORTHY IN CONVERSATION WITH ANDREW GRAHAM-DIXON\\u0026nbsp;is f\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eilmed entirely on-site at the National Galleries of Scotland during Goldsworthy's monumental 2025 retrospective, Andy Goldsworthy: 50 Years, this compelling film captures an exclusive, deeply personal dialogue between the world-renowned land artist and the acclaimed art historian, author, and broadcaster.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe documentary offers an unprecedented look behind the scenes of Goldsworthy’s largest and most ambitious indoor exhibition. Surrounded by new installations created specifically for the show, the pair explore the core environmental philosophies, fleeting natural materials, and creative ideas that have defined the artist's extraordinary half-century career.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe screening will be followed by a live Q\\u0026amp;A with\\u0026nbsp;Andrew\\u0026nbsp;Graham-\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eDixon.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Andrew Graham-Dixon\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-09-13\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-09-13\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"460343\",\"time\":\"2026-09-13T13:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":10,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":50,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers qa\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38022\",\"name\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: JAMES McNEILL WHISTLER\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-james-mcneill-whistler\",\"posterImage\":\"7v85am6jwubg8fftqc51t4llop9l\",\"bannerImage\":\"7o0z54kmgyqy8r8n06sb2ngaqqsi\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eIn an era of great change and great beauty emerged the character of\\u0026nbsp;James McNeill Whistler. Considered by some to be one of the great innovators of 19th century art, he was a contemporary of the Impressionists, much admired by Van Gogh and Manet. Boldly experimental and famously witty, Whistler disrupted the strict conventions of Victorian society in pursuit of a new cult of beauty, creating “art for art’s sake” and earning himself a place in the history of great art. He found a parallel between painting and music, and entitled many of his paintings “arrangements”, “harmonies” and “nocturnes”, emphasizing the importance of tonal harmony in his work.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eHis most famous painting,\\u0026nbsp;Arrangement in Grey and Black No. 1\\u0026nbsp;(1871), commonly known as\\u0026nbsp;Whistler’s Mother, is a revered and often parodied portrait of motherhood. It is arguably one of the most famous paintings in history and this film will unveil the artist behind the art.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eTate Britain is now holding the first major retrospective of Whistler in three decades. This blockbuster exhibition promises to reawaken the world to just how important Whistler is to art history, uniting world-famous masterpieces with rarely seen works. Exhibition on Screen will bring these stunning works and the incredible story behind them to cinemas around the world while the exhibition is still running, bringing this truly global artist to a global audience. This will be an unmissable chance to get to know this visually spectacular artist and the influence he has had on those who followed.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eMade in close collaboration with Tate Britain.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"David Bickerstaff\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-09-15\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-09-15\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"511703\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: James Mcneill Whistler 2026 (Exhibition) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"400\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442729\",\"time\":\"2026-09-15T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":53,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event eos\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38550\",\"name\":\"NT LIVE: THE MISANTHROPE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"nt-live-the-misanthrope\",\"posterImage\":\"pp2vvbhbqoth6zrctgq70xy8vgpo\",\"bannerImage\":\"tzmenu4asb2s0hmeub19makwkovo\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-width: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\\"\\u003eAward-winner Sandra Oh (Killing Eve) plays the title role in this razor-sharp reimagining of Molière’s classic dark comedy.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-width: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\\"\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-width: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\\"\\u003eTelling the truth isn’t always that simple. Alice, a brilliant novelist, despises the carefully constructed lies of modern society. But the more she challenges those around her, the fiercer the backlash becomes. Soon, she must confront the price of speaking her truth in a world that would rather silence her.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-width: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\\"\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-width: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\\"\\u003eFilmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp’s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Sandra Oh, Paul Chahidi, Tom Mison, Abigal Cruttenden\",\"directedBy\":\"Indhu Rubasingham\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":150,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-09-22\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-09-22\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"64275\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"NT Live: The Comedy Of Errors (2D) [NR]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"160\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"447228\",\"time\":\"2026-09-22T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":15,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event nt-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39271\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: MACBETH\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-macbeth\",\"posterImage\":\"4qqj0icfume374cqht1accez59sh\",\"bannerImage\":\"j3v4cscihvfb24gvtwt0ld1ozh9j\",\"synopsis\":\"Two of opera’s most extraordinary artists return to The Met: Live in HD for Verdi’s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale of the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost. Following past triumphs in many of Verdi’s signature baritone roles, Quinn Kelsey is the Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous ascent to the throne, opposite Lise Davidsen—the world’s reigning dramatic soprano—as the power-mad Lady Macbeth, whose ruinous ambition damns them both. Met Music Director Yannick Nézet-Séguin takes the podium for a penetrating production by Louisa Proske, a brilliant young director making waves around the world. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso as the heroic Macduff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Macbeth’s friend-turned-victim Banquo.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThis production is part of the Met’s award-winning Live in HD series, bringing opera to cinemas across the globe.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 30min / 210min, One Interval\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eSung in Italian with English subtitles\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Quinn Kelsey, Lise Davidsen, Freddie De Tommaso, Ryan Speedo Green\",\"directedBy\":\"Louisa Proske\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-10-20\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-10-20\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461259\",\"time\":\"2026-10-20T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":70,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37162\",\"name\":\"LIVE CONCERT: GYPSY DYNAMITE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"live-concert-gypsy-dynamite\",\"posterImage\":\"8gw7a91zyg4vafua37lgj73hgspl\",\"bannerImage\":\"sl5jbitj6kjpejo1sn71q7qoulij\",\"synopsis\":\"Gypsy Dynamite is an acoustic guitar duo rooted in the tradition of Django Reinhardt, fusing the fire of Gypsy Swing with influences drawn from Italian jazz, classical music, and rock. The project began in 2011 when two guitarists crossed paths at a pub in West London and recognised, in an instant, that something uncommon was there.\\n\\nOver the fifteen years that followed, the duo built a reputation on stages across Europe and beyond — drawing in audiences who had never encountered anything quite like it: music that is simultaneously virtuosic and visceral, deeply rooted yet entirely original. The live show has always been the heart of it — raw, spontaneous, and built on real interaction between two musicians who know each other's playing intuitively. \\n\\nFor the 15th anniversary, Gypsy Dynamite returned to the studio — just the two of them, the guitars, and the music they have devoted themselves to for a decade and a half. The result is a brand-new show premiering in the UK this October: a celebration of fifteen years of partnership, perseverance, and music that continues to surprise even its creators.\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-10-21\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-10-21\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"277\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"430248\",\"time\":\"2026-10-21T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":12,\"screenId\":\"301\",\"seatsRemaining\":38,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"special-event fun-in-the-lounge live-music\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39272\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: MANON\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-manon\",\"posterImage\":\"4wseib3uxcmko7zghu6fj0syyfmo\",\"bannerImage\":\"nogs00r4keiiivtei9b1zf3p55ia\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eIn the seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris, money is king. Nothing is sacred – even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hedonistic underworld, Manon is caught between twin desires when she falls in love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted, he offers the possibility of an honourable life. Yet, the riches promised by the world of Parisian society remain tempting.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eManon’s inner turmoil and struggle for survival lie at the devastating heart of Kenneth MacMillan’s 1974 adaptation of Abbé Prévost’s novel. In this signature work of The Royal Ballet, MacMillan’s nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an unflinching look into the moral degradation of Manon’s Paris, while all its decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules Massenet’s score and Nicholas Georgiadis’s designs.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 10min / 190min, Two Intervals\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":190,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-10-27\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-10-27\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461260\",\"time\":\"2026-10-27T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":72,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38641\",\"name\":\"GENERAL WITCHFINDERS PRESENT: DR JEKYLL \\u0026 SISTER HYDE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"general-witchfinders-present-dr-jekyll-sister-hyde\",\"posterImage\":\"cqut2rfai5kkkiswvse5aac0p9wn\",\"bannerImage\":\"dp6rf0iac2onjihjk6xb3534l6zr\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eExpect a night of trivia, tangents, and laughs at the screening of Hammer's gender-swapping 1971 curiosity \\u003ci\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDr Jekyll \\u0026amp; Sister Hyde\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/i\\u003e. Then stay for a live recording of the UK's top ten film history podcast with the General Witchfinders.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eDirected by Roy Ward Baker (Scars of Dracula, Quatermass and the Pit) and written by Brian Clemens (Captain Kronos: Vampire Hunter), this version of the Stevenson classic takes a wild turn by introducing a female alter-ego, while weaving real-life historical figures Jack the Ripper and Burke and Hare into the plot. Starburst Magazine praised it as ‘one of the most ingenious adaptations of a classic horror tale,’ noting that ‘it is Martine Beswick who steals the show... she creates an air of sexual magnetism and cunning that offsets the doctor’s neurotic predicament.’\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAfter the credits roll, the General Witchfinders team – Ross Cleaver, James Randall, and Jon Pountney – take to the stage. Bringing a mountain of facts mixed with an obsession for the more bizarre side of British culture. The team will examine the cast, crew, and production history, along with any weird and wonderful side roads their research and conversation leads them down – an approach that saw the podcast selected for the British Library’s National Sound Archive.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003ePlease Note: This film was produced in 1971 and contains outdated attitudes and language that reflect the period in which it was made.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Ralph Bates, Martine Beswick, Gerald Sim\",\"directedBy\":\"Roy Ward Baker\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":150,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"P6D7bzltR2U\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-10-30\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-10-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"20458\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"General (Re: 2006), The (2D) [U]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"141\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"449749\",\"time\":\"2026-10-30T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":29,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":45,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event spooky-season no-ads--trailers qa\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39273\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: CARMEN\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-carmen\",\"posterImage\":\"85i5iespw2uyzcqsfa5ukxjg6n2p\",\"bannerImage\":\"59vim8sn7w7c6puf1he2bi5b7oly\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eUnder the oppressive heat of the Spanish sun, the fiercely independent Carmen attracts the attention of Don José. She warns him not to fall in love with her, but his obsession knows no bounds. Damiano Michieletto’s searing production returns, casting scorching light on the lust, violence and destructive desire of Bizet’s ever-popular opera.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eAn all-star cast brings this white-hot drama to life, with Ginger Costa-Jackson in the fiery title role, alongside Russell Thomas as the jealous and despairing Don José. Following his 2023 Royal Opera debut, Sesto Quatrini returns to conduct Bizet’s electrifying and sensual score.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 35min / 215min, One Interval\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eSung in French with English subtitles.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Ginger Costa-Jackson, Russell Thomas, Adriana González, Alexander Vinogradov, Barnaby Rea\",\"directedBy\":\"Damiano Michieletto\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":215,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-11-10\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-10\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461261\",\"time\":\"2026-11-10T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":69,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39282\",\"name\":\"GIANT – The Play\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"giant-the-play\",\"posterImage\":\"n5lejuliu8yvyolb71e3484sz0ps\",\"bannerImage\":\"ambw36h4optcqpmqhduh2cchwvek\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eGIANT, the 5-star critically acclaimed play starring John Lithgow (Killers of the Flower Moon, The Crown) as Roald Dahl, comes to the big screen. Winner of 3 Olivier Awards® including Best Play and a Tony Award® for Best Actor in a Play (John Lithgow), the production was filmed live in London’s West End ahead of its sold-out Broadway run. The stellar cast includes Aya Cash (The Boys, The Franchise, You’re the Worst), Elliot Levey (Cold War, Patriots, Good) and Rachael Stirling (The Divine Mrs S).\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eA world-famous children’s author under threat. A battle of wills in the wake of scandal. And one chance to make amends...It’s the summer of 1983, The Witches is about to hit the shelves and Roald Dahl is making last-minute edits. \\u0026nbsp;But the outcry at his recent, explicitly antisemitic article won’t die down. Across a single afternoon at his family home, and rocked by an unexpectedly explosive confrontation, Dahl is forced to choose: make a public apology or risk his name and reputation. Inspired by real events, GIANT explores with dark humour the difference between considered opinion and dangerous rhetoric offering a complicated portrait of a fiendishly charismatic icon.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"John Lithgow, Aya Cash, Elliot Levey, Rachael Stirling\",\"directedBy\":\"Nicholas Hytner\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":136,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-11-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-11-19\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"164\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461329\",\"time\":\"2026-11-19T19:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":74,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"461330\",\"time\":\"2026-11-22T15:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":71,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event no-ads--trailers\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39274\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: THE NUTCRACKER\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-the-nutcracker\",\"posterImage\":\"0kocvkmq6z5uhdf8km0d53x5uj8e\",\"bannerImage\":\"u83eplhvnq7s5kd958lojh0aulq1\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eAt a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys come alive and the magic never stops.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003ePeter Wright’s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of Tchaikovsky’s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman’s period designs.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 2h 20min / 140min, One Interval\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Mayara Magri, Reece Clarke , James Hay, Marianna Tsembenhoi, Taisuke Nakao\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":140,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-12-01\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-12-01\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461262\",\"time\":\"2026-12-01T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":71,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38030\",\"name\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: RENOIR \\u0026 LOVE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-renoir-love\",\"posterImage\":\"rvfte6qqd19ezhfeoqd94mmbyc9y\",\"bannerImage\":\"gi5df0atnbx8umlgpb0fjg92rlpe\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003ePierre-Auguste Renoir\\u0026nbsp;is one of the world’s favourite artists; a founding member of the Impressionist movement and a constantly evolving artist, he is unmatched at depicting human connection. The National Gallery’s blockbuster exhibition brings together vibrant masterpieces which explore love in all its forms, bringing colour and warmth into the cold winter months.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eWith exclusive access to this exciting new show, Exhibition on Screen will bring these world class works to cinema audiences, with close examination of the art and leading experts exploring the immense skill and influence of this master of colour and connection. Be transported back to a Parisian summer of love through the eyes of a true visionary. An unmissable opportunity to fall in love with Renoir this winter.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eMade in close collaboration with The National Gallery, London\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eand Musee d’Orsay, Paris.\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"Ali Ray\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-01-19\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-01-19\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"511702\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Renoir \\u0026amp; Love 2027 (Exhibition) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"400\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"442730\",\"time\":\"2027-01-19T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":58,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event eos\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39275\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: LA FANCIULLA DEL WEST\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-la-fanciulla-del-west\",\"posterImage\":\"e6k786yem4m4y7vku8bb4chdio4t\",\"bannerImage\":\"cr6klmldpilrlrikblefwcd83wb9\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003ePuccini’s exhilarating drama of the Wild West returns in a new staging by Richard Jones, marking the\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003ecompany’s first new production of La Fanciulla del West in more than 30 years. Soprano Vida\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eMiknevičiūtė makes her Met company debut singing the role of Minnie, the tough tavern owner with\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003ea heart of gold who finds love when she least expects it. Tenor SeokJong Baek is the dashing bandit\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003ewho rambles into the remote California mining town to steal her heart, opposite baritone\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eChristopher Maltman as the lawman determined to deliver justice—and win Minnie for himself.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eMaestro Keri-Lynn Wilson takes the podium to conduct one of opera’s most action-packed\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eadventures, live from the Met stage to cinemas worldwide.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThis production is part of the Met’s award-winning Live in HD series, bringing opera to cinemas across the globe.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 15min / 195min, One Interval\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eSung in Italian with English subtitles.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Sondra Radvanovsky, Seokjong Baek, Christopher Maltman\",\"directedBy\":\"Richard Jones\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":195,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-01-26\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-01-26\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"62279\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet 2013 (Ballet) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461270\",\"time\":\"2027-01-26T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":72,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39276\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: GÖTTERDÄMMERUNG\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-gtterdmmerung\",\"posterImage\":\"kced00k0wi6tu64ti4mkdmo7pjl5\",\"bannerImage\":\"znaagxi3kb0p1exi824te3yp9e4m\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eAn earth in ruin. The twilight of the Gods.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eDeception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Brünnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved’s innocence, Brünnhilde at last returns the ring to the Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames. For the long-awaited finale of Wagner’s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary world of dream-like turmoil. Antonio Pappano, Conductor Laureate of The Royal Opera, returns to take on the impassioned, otherworldly music – including Siegfried’s transporting Funeral March and Brünnhilde’s electrifying Immolation Scene. The brilliant cast is led by Elisabet Strid, Andreas Schager and Mika Kares, who together with the full forces of the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House and the Royal Opera Chorus bring opera’s greatest journey to its shattering end.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 5h 50min / 350min, Two Intervals\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eSung in German with English subtitles.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Andreas Schager, Thomas Lehman, Mika Kares, Christopher Purve, Elisabet Strid\",\"directedBy\":\"Barrie Kosky\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":350,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-02-03\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-02-03\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461271\",\"time\":\"2027-02-03T16:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":72,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39277\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: COSÌ FAN TUTTE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-cos-fan-tutte\",\"posterImage\":\"bzk11ikbw8dgprilh7k8dixh2urq\",\"bannerImage\":\"lp9ogpzbvp7jbs41u2h7mffx8nlq\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eSpurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eCosì fan tutte has lost none of its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stage debut, Netia Jones, Associate Director of The Royal Opera, reimagines Mozart’s comedy of manners through a sharp contemporary lens, where 18th-century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical high-tech deceit. Taking on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder, Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall, with Gerald Finley as their manipulative game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as Despina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts, bringing out the exquisite melodies that underpin the provocative, and resolutely modern, themes at the heart of the opera.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eMusic:\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eWolfgang Amadeus Mozart\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 30min / 210min, One Interval\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eSung in Italian with English subtitles.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Louise Alder, Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei\",\"directedBy\":\"Netia Jones\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":210,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-02-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-02-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461272\",\"time\":\"2027-02-23T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":73,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39278\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: ALICE’S ADVENTURES IN WONDERLAND\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-alices-adventures-in-wonderland\",\"posterImage\":\"xpxjzypt0rmfbfgd8w5iz7941v1b\",\"bannerImage\":\"cdale31bbf2d3se2yz0zo27lu0q5\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eAt a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream?\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eChristopher Wheeldon’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot’s score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley’s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious music and design.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 2h 50min / 170min, Two Intervals\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Francesca Hayward, William Bracewell, James Hay\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":170,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-03-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-03-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"62279\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet 2013 (Ballet) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461273\",\"time\":\"2027-03-23T19:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":71,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39279\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: SWAN LAKE\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-swan-lake\",\"posterImage\":\"hbsujps7e1tm1e4z4l6602hmpwvw\",\"bannerImage\":\"ukim610opa49dko104q29hui741n\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003ePrincess Odette is bound by a curse, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and pledges to free her. But freedom is not promised for Odette as Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers’ plans.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eLiam Scarlett’s production for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky’s towering score and John Macfarlane’s picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet spectacle of love, treachery and forgiveness.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 25min / 205min, Two Intervals\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":205,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-04-22\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-04-22\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"62279\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet 2013 (Ballet) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461274\",\"time\":\"2027-04-22T18:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":73,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39280\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: TOSCA\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-tosca\",\"posterImage\":\"f0wfelwuduccl0ngznrtrkp3hpio\",\"bannerImage\":\"52e90oesmx1matkbrukkdy7kbvem\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eFloria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia’s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eOliver Mears’s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini’s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 3h 15min / 195min, Two Intervals\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eSung in Italian with English subtitles.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Aleksandra Kurzak, Saimir Pirgu, Saimir Pirgu\",\"directedBy\":\"Oliver Mears\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":195,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-05-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-05-05\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"62279\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet 2013 (Ballet) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461275\",\"time\":\"2027-05-05T18:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":72,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38031\",\"name\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: MONET\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"exhibition-on-screen-monet\",\"posterImage\":\"foau5tf3x8otro7ecwdt8ibjpyr3\",\"bannerImage\":\"3xhovne0szujsbxfzk0tqs2ffhti\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eTo celebrate Tate Britain’s blockbuster Monet and Time exhibition, Exhibition on Screen is delighted to bring the iconic story of\\u0026nbsp;Claude Monet\\u0026nbsp;to cinema screens in May 2027.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eUndeniably one of the world’s favourite artists and the figurehead of the Impressionist movement prepare to be dazzled by his spectacular and revolutionary use of light and colour and step into one the most famous gardens in art history.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eImmerse yourself in iconic masterpieces and discover the incredible story of passion and rebellion in this exciting documentary on the man who named the world’s favourite art movement.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-family: Lato; caret-color: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\\\"\\u003eFurther details to come.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-05-11\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-05-11\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"514375\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Monet 2027 (Exhibition) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"400\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461257\",\"time\":\"2027-05-11T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":74,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 special-event eos\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"39281\",\"name\":\"ROYAL BALLET \\u0026 OPERA LIVE: ROMEO AND JULIET\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"royal-ballet-opera-live-romeo-and-juliet\",\"posterImage\":\"08ststhhm7w40az87me48vbxis2j\",\"bannerImage\":\"tco24q74q35t2wopm9x2shnwlkbb\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe Capulets and Montagues are sworn enemies. Yet it is love at first sight for Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet when they meet each other at the Capulet ball, into which Romeo has snuck. The two fall in love and they profess their devotion to each other at Juliet’s balcony. They secretly get married. \\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe stakes are raised for the young couple when Romeo avenges the death of his friend Mercutio who has been killed by Tybalt, Juliet’s cousin. For this, Romeo is exiled from Verona. Meanwhile, Juliet’s parents are forcing her to marry another suitor. In order to be together, Romeo and Juliet must risk it all. \\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eApproximate runtime: 2h 50min / 170min, Two Intervals\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Fumi Kaneko, Vadim Muntagirov\",\"directedBy\":\"\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":170,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"tbc\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2027-05-25\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2027-05-25\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"62279\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Alice's Adventures In Wonderland - Royal Ballet 2013 (Ballet) (2D) [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"93\",\"titleClassId\":\"398\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"461962\",\"time\":\"2027-05-25T18:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"140\",\"seatsRemaining\":59,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"sc1 royal-ballet--opera-live\\\"}\"}]}]}}}",
